 "anterior": "CL029",
 "titulo": "Why China eats mooncakes under the moon 🌕 Part 3 #mythology #shorts",
 "capa": "SHE FLOATED TO THE MOON",
 "descripcion": "Chang'e drank the elixir and floated to the moon, where she lives with a jade rabbit. In many tellings, a thief made her choose.\n\nSources: Huainanzi, chapter 6, and later folk versions.\n\nWhat would you have done?\n\n#mythology #chinesemythology #change #houyi #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "In the oldest version, Chang'e drinks the elixir herself.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Maybe she was afraid of growing old. The old texts don't say.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "In a later one, a thief breaks in, and she drinks it so he can't.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "His name is Peng Meng, one of Hou Yi's own students.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He waits until his master goes hunting, then breaks in with a sword.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Either way, she becomes light, and floats up into the sky.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She rises past the roof, past the clouds.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Hou Yi comes home, and calls her name into the sky.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She stops at the moon, the closest place to home.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her only company is a lonely palace, and a man cutting a tree.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every time he cuts it, the tree heals again.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "There, a jade rabbit pounds medicine under a cassia tree.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Hou Yi sets out her favorite fruit and cakes, under the full moon.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Some say she can see him, on the brightest night of the year.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "People still do it, at the Mid-Autumn Festival.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Families eat mooncakes, and look up at the full moon together.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Would you have drunk it, or stayed?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
